<title>USA: HILB, ROGAL NAMES CAROLYN JONES CFO.</title>
<headline>HILB, ROGAL NAMES CAROLYN JONES CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GLEN ALLEN, Va. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilb, Rogal and Hamilton Co, a leading insurance brokerage firm, said Wednesday it named Carolyn Jones chief financial officer, senior vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>She replaces Timothy Korman, who was named executive vice president for finance and administration.</p>
<p>Jones has been vice president and controller of the company since 1991. Wednesday, 6 August 1997 15:14:29 ENDS  nN06235534</p>
